          "key": "presented_topics",
          "type": "checklist",
          "label": "Employee Equipment acknowledgment topics",
          "items": [
            "Asset tag, serial number, model, and assigned custodian were verified",
            "Issued condition and included accessories were recorded",
            "Security configuration and approved account setup were confirmed",
            "Storage, transport, physical protection, and acceptable-use duties were explained",
            "Loss, theft, damage, or suspected compromise reporting route was provided",
            "Support, repair, replacement, and loaner process was explained",
            "Personal use, shared access, and unapproved software limits were reviewed",
            "Return trigger, destination, due point, and data-handling steps were confirmed"
